(VoteApp - Campus Election Android App \\(repo summary\\)) Tj
/F1 12 Tf
14 TL
T*
(What it is: Android app for campus elections using Firebase Auth and Realtime DB.) Tj
T*
(Who it's for: Campus election admins, student voters, and candidate applicants.) Tj
T*
T*
(What it does:) Tj
T*
(- Role-based login via Firebase Auth; student login can require fingerprint.) Tj
T*
(- Capture student IDs with camera and ML Kit; save locally for voting.) Tj
T*
(- Geofenced, time-bound sessions; fused location checks inside admin-set radius.) Tj
T*
(- Voting syncs to Firebase and Room, blocks duplicate student IDs, tags time/location.) Tj
T*
(- Candidate flow: applicants upload profile/docs; admins approve or reject and publish.) Tj
T*
(- Admin tools: broadcasts with optional SMS, clear cloud data, results charts and PDF export.) Tj
T*
T*
(How it works:) Tj
T*
(- Shell: Splash -> Login/Register -> MainActivity with role-aware tabs.) Tj
T*
(- Tabs cover voting, ID scan, broadcasts, geofence, results, candidates.) Tj
T*
(- Cloud: Firebase Auth + Realtime DB for users, candidates, votes, geofence, broadcasts.) Tj
T*
(- Offline persistence enabled in VoteApp Application.) Tj
T*
(- Local cache: Room stores votes, candidates, users, broadcasts, geofence.) Tj
T*
(- SessionManager keeps role, name, department, year in SharedPreferences.) Tj
T*
(- Services: ML Kit text recognition and fused location for geofence checks.) Tj
T*
(- Services: BiometricPrompt for login/vote; MPAndroidChart and PdfDocument for results.) Tj
T*
T*
(How to run:) Tj
T*
(1\\) Open in Android Studio \\(compileSdk 35, Java 11\\); let Gradle sync.) Tj
T*
(2\\) Keep or replace app/src/google-services.json with your Firebase config.) Tj
T*
(3\\) Enable Firebase Auth and Realtime Database in the project.) Tj
T*
(4\\) Run on Play-services device/emulator; grant Camera and Location; SMS only for broadcasts.) Tj
T*
(5\\) Register accounts; pick admin or candidate role to access those screens.) Tj
T*
ET
